# CUDA Toolkit headers are NOT vendored (see docs/ascend/Compliance.md).
# `python tools/fetch_cuda_fp16_headers.py` copies them from the local CUDA
# Toolkit / conda / nvidia-* wheel; the copies must never be committed, and
# MANIFEST.in + setup.py keep them out of sdist/wheel.
